# Spoonacular API key (client app).
#
# The EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix is required for Expo to inline the value into the
# JavaScript bundle. That means the key is NOT secret: anyone who inspects the
# shipped bundle can extract it. Treat it as a public client credential and
# rotate it if it is exposed. A backend proxy would be required to keep it
# private, which this project intentionally does not add.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SPOONACULAR_API_KEY=